  "answer": "Every string behind Add Block's search, read by typing alone: 5300 queries. Each letter, each pair, each pair grown while its tile stays, each triple the pairs allow, then two strings joined. CAP-U5PHRASES.json finishes the phrases. The list in words predicts all 95 words in CAP-U5WORDS.json, the 450 in CAP-U5PHRASES.json and the 49 in CAP-U5RULE.json, with no misses. 175 strings on 37 tiles. A word inside a longer string on the same tile, like link in content link, is not listed apart. j, digits and marks give nothing, except - on Pricing Plan, and ' and ! on Zola.",
